Object of Parent Class should be replaceable with objects of Child class without breaking code

For Example :

Bird(ABC)
   -eat()
   -fly()

Sparrow(Bird)
   -eat()
   -fly()

Penquin(Bird)
   -eat()
   -fly() -> this will not work

Hence the design is not Optimal and Child can't substitute for Parent Class

Child class is-a Parent class -> Child should work exactly like Parent
Child should not break behavior of Paren class

No Class should be forced to implement methods which it doesn't use
Split large interfaces into smaller , more specific ones